# GitHub Pages publishes EVERY tracked file on `main` verbatim (.nojekyll disables
# Jekyll, so `_config.yml`'s `exclude:` is inert). Anything committed here is served
# publicly at geesly.net/<path>. Untracking is the only way to keep a file off the site.

# Local-only working notes. Kept at the repo root because Claude Code auto-loads
# ./CLAUDE.md and would not find it in a subdirectory.
CLAUDE.md
.private/

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# Node (npm run dev pulls live-server via npx)
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
